WEBVTT

00:01.980 --> 00:06.730
Did you already know that Heavensky 
had these underground passages?

00:06.730 --> 00:09.180
In the Grand Hoshin Church,

00:09.180 --> 00:11.490
information gathering is 
part of a missionary's job.

00:12.360 --> 00:17.740
How much time and manpower would it 
even take to build something like this?

00:17.740 --> 00:21.250
The scale is crazy for something whose 
only purpose is as an escape route

00:21.250 --> 00:22.820
for one Emperor-Unifier.

00:25.010 --> 00:29.470
Whatever the case, right now, 
we're lucky this corridor is here.

00:32.690 --> 00:34.900
What the heck? Is this a dead end?

00:34.900 --> 00:35.890
No.

00:36.750 --> 00:37.860
Look up.

00:38.410 --> 00:41.250
Good Albert, I need a shoulder to lean on.

00:41.250 --> 00:42.770
H-Hey!

00:43.370 --> 00:46.080
The shoulder thing wasn't a metaphor?!

00:46.080 --> 00:47.770
Keep standing firm.

00:56.450 --> 00:57.910
So this is the exit?

00:57.910 --> 01:01.040
Yes. Boost me up first.

01:05.400 --> 01:06.490
Okay!

01:13.110 --> 01:15.050
What is this room?

01:15.720 --> 01:17.050
A powder room.

01:17.050 --> 01:19.270
A pow—this is a toilet?!

01:19.270 --> 01:21.890
I assume it's the emperor's private one.

01:21.890 --> 01:26.560
This is the type of place where 
secret passages are typically built.

01:27.900 --> 01:30.310
There's a celestial force field over there.

01:31.430 --> 01:32.960
Let's check it out.

01:37.010 --> 01:40.350
Something's wrong. 
There ought to be far more guards.

01:40.350 --> 01:42.750
Shall we stay out of sight 
and watch for a bit?

01:43.320 --> 01:44.870
No, let's keep going.

01:48.190 --> 01:49.280
What's this?

01:49.280 --> 01:51.920
Probably the emperor's bedchamber.

01:54.830 --> 01:56.840
It's not even locked?!

01:56.840 --> 01:57.690
Shh!

02:02.730 --> 02:05.700
Your Majesty, we humbly seek an audience.

02:06.600 --> 02:09.230
Please forgive our rudeness 
in disturbing your bedchamber.

02:13.030 --> 02:15.090
Wait—there's no celestial force field here.

02:15.090 --> 02:17.110
That's not the Emperor-Unifier.

02:17.110 --> 02:18.360
What?

02:37.800 --> 02:39.880
<b>The Devil is a Part-Timer! Season 2</b>

03:52.160 --> 03:57.130
m 370 218 l 609 218 609 245 370 245

03:53.070 --> 03:57.130
Why would this place be so deserted?

03:53.870 --> 03:57.130
<b>The Hero Dances on the Battlefield</b>

03:53.870 --> 03:57.130
<b>The Hero Dances on the Battlefield</b>

03:59.090 --> 04:01.910
If you're confident in your skill, follow me.

04:01.910 --> 04:03.630
Lady Emilia?

04:03.630 --> 04:07.000
I assume you don't mind 
if I spearhead the attack.

04:07.000 --> 04:12.010
I'll ask again: Is what you said 
about hiyayakko and ginger bud true?

04:12.750 --> 04:17.710
Manifest now, my power! So that we may 
vanquish those with evil in their hearts!

04:19.840 --> 04:21.600
It's the second coming of the Hero!

04:21.600 --> 04:23.380
She's like a saint!

04:23.380 --> 04:25.050
Some "hero" I am.

04:25.560 --> 04:28.370
Emilia, if you step out of line...

04:28.990 --> 04:30.540
Yes, I know.

04:30.540 --> 04:34.370
I'll fight Alciel at full power. 
That's what you want, right?

04:36.820 --> 04:41.520
Our target is Demon General Alciel
 in the castle keep!

04:41.520 --> 04:43.020
Follow me!

04:43.020 --> 04:44.720
Divine Boots of Light!

04:50.420 --> 04:52.910
If it's not the emperor, then who—

04:52.910 --> 04:54.800
Let me stop you right there.

04:56.900 --> 04:58.520
Gabriel!

04:58.520 --> 05:04.640
Sneaking into the emperor's bedchamber 
is cheeky even for you, isn't it?

05:08.810 --> 05:10.410
I can't move!

05:10.410 --> 05:11.960
A Gate?

05:11.960 --> 05:14.850
You got pretty close!

05:14.850 --> 05:18.670
But he's a valuable hostage, 
so we took some precautions.

05:18.670 --> 05:21.800
Oh! Have a fun fact as a consolation prize:

05:22.420 --> 05:24.670
This is Emilia's father.

05:24.670 --> 05:27.680
The Emperor-Unifier is someplace else.

05:36.550 --> 05:37.800
Where are we?

05:38.280 --> 05:39.980
The western continent.

05:40.410 --> 05:43.980
As far as I know, it's the only place 
these flowers grow.

05:43.980 --> 05:46.780
He blew us that far away?

05:46.780 --> 05:49.620
It'll take days to get back to Efzahan!

05:51.250 --> 05:53.120
So we're out of options?

06:15.740 --> 06:21.900
How good of you to come, Emilia! 
And with your bedraggled band of soldiers!

06:22.290 --> 06:24.000
Emilia the Hero,

06:24.000 --> 06:28.940
you come to challenge me despite knowing 
the power of my hiyayakko and ginger bud?

06:28.940 --> 06:31.030
How foolish!

06:31.520 --> 06:34.210
You're the foolish one, Alciel.

06:34.210 --> 06:38.050
My sword and I don't need any 
ginger bud with our hiyayakko!

06:38.050 --> 06:40.550
"Ginger bud"?

06:40.550 --> 06:42.040
"Hiyayakko"?

06:42.040 --> 06:47.090
I suppose I'll just have to 
force you to see reality.

06:47.090 --> 06:51.000
Hero, our last battle ended in a draw.

06:51.000 --> 06:54.070
Let us settle that score now, one on one!

06:54.070 --> 06:55.790
Sounds good to me.

06:57.030 --> 06:59.940
Wait, Emilia! Don't let him provoke you!

07:01.690 --> 07:03.190
Olba Mayer!

07:04.400 --> 07:08.380
Surely you don't intend to 
interfere with their battle.

07:08.380 --> 07:10.820
We have questions for you.

07:10.820 --> 07:15.320
If you insist on interfering, 
you'll have to go through us.

07:18.870 --> 07:20.830
Will he really come?

07:21.310 --> 07:22.830
Without fail.

07:22.830 --> 07:25.400
Based on his MgRonald's shifts,

07:25.400 --> 07:28.210
he should be able to make his 
move on Thursday afternoon.

07:28.580 --> 07:33.050
Still, I don't know 
precisely when he'll arrive...

07:33.050 --> 07:35.100
or what the result will be.

07:36.390 --> 07:39.600
I trust you know our current task.

07:40.160 --> 07:46.680
Since our hands are tied, 
we'll dance until our strength runs out!

07:47.730 --> 07:49.360
Isn't that right?

07:56.190 --> 07:59.370
Oh, you're awake. How do you feel?

08:00.400 --> 08:04.880
My head kinda hurts. My neck, too.

08:05.270 --> 08:07.880
Not surprising, considering how you flew.

08:07.880 --> 08:09.670
What was that about?

08:10.390 --> 08:16.520
I'm not sure, but my chest filled with 
something warm, and then... yeah.

08:17.840 --> 08:22.770
Well, whatever. If you're feeling better,
 we'll leave this inn ASAP.

08:23.160 --> 08:26.920
I haven't been able to contact 
Suzuno or Albert for eight hours.

08:27.820 --> 08:31.940
Since our hands are tied, I want to 
at least try to get some intel.

08:34.090 --> 08:38.310
H-Hey, does that mean Alas 
Ramus is fighting right now?

08:39.190 --> 08:43.910
That way. Yesod is fighting super 
hard against some dark black force.

08:43.910 --> 08:46.170
That way is Heavensky.

08:47.010 --> 08:49.940
Shit, how come I can't sense it?!

08:49.940 --> 08:53.920
Maou, let's go! Big Sis is right nearby!

08:53.920 --> 08:57.430
Even if you're useless, I can 
try to do something by myself!

08:57.430 --> 08:59.930
Hold up. By yourself?

09:00.600 --> 09:06.150
You left your fusion with Nord 
to fuse with me, right?

09:06.150 --> 09:07.380
Yep.

09:07.380 --> 09:10.690
So can you leave your fusion with me, too?

09:10.690 --> 09:14.820
You mean re-fuse with Dad or something?

09:14.820 --> 09:16.960
I'm not sure.

09:17.390 --> 09:22.080
But you didn't hesitate to 
fuse with me at Chi's school.

09:22.080 --> 09:25.330
Yeah, cuz you seemed like 
you'd be easy to fuse with.

09:25.790 --> 09:30.340
But there've been lots of side effects, 
so I guess we're a bad match.

09:31.000 --> 09:36.520
Looking back, Chiho or Lucifer 
might've been better choices.

09:36.520 --> 09:38.340
Chi? Urushihara?

09:38.890 --> 09:45.030
Say, Acieth, I thought you and 
Alas Ramus were the "mistletoe,"

09:45.030 --> 09:46.980
but is it actually us?

09:46.980 --> 09:52.480
Yep! Everyone with knowledge of this 
world is mistletoe for the sephiroth.

09:55.310 --> 09:58.650
Forget that! Let's go find Big Sis!

09:58.650 --> 10:01.490
If you don't move, I can't move either!

10:01.490 --> 10:04.340
Okay, I'll go! Just calm down!

10:08.120 --> 10:11.560
Maou, are we really going on scooters?

10:11.560 --> 10:15.130
Flying is faster, and then I can 
beat the bad guys with Big Sis.

10:15.130 --> 10:19.130
They'll find us if we fly. 
You can drive, right?

10:19.130 --> 10:22.780
Sure. I studied with Dad.

10:22.780 --> 10:24.050
But...

10:24.050 --> 10:28.640
Don't do anything to tip off Gabriel and 
the others about us until the last moment.

10:28.640 --> 10:31.240
We're vulnerable—if they 
come at us through a Gate,

10:31.240 --> 10:33.900
there's no guarantee we'll able to 
join forces with Alas Ramus.

10:35.690 --> 10:37.240
<b>Joint birthday party!
 Happy birthday to Miss Yusa, too</b>

10:45.160 --> 10:46.570
Let's go, Acieth!

10:46.570 --> 10:48.100
I'm ready to do it to it!

10:59.990 --> 11:01.680
Holy Flame Slice!

11:03.680 --> 11:04.970
That's nothing!

11:09.520 --> 11:10.940
Piercing Aerial Flash!

11:13.690 --> 11:15.690
Hiyayakko! Ginger bud!

11:16.800 --> 11:19.190
Looks like this'll be a war of attrition.

11:19.720 --> 11:22.950
Still, that's all we can do.

11:23.450 --> 11:27.450
I owe you an apology for something.

11:27.700 --> 11:32.920
We killed a lot of your... 
of the demon realm's citizens

11:32.920 --> 11:35.280
because I was too weak to stop it.

11:35.280 --> 11:36.460
I'm sorry.

11:36.860 --> 11:41.960
Neither you nor I had the power 
to crush all the obstacles in our path.

11:41.960 --> 11:43.700
That's all.

11:44.490 --> 11:49.220
In any case, I hope Alas Ramus 
hasn't caught a cold or taken ill.

11:49.750 --> 11:54.550
She's healthy. She's a lot 
tougher than we are, you know.

11:54.860 --> 11:58.100
I'm glad to hear it!

12:02.130 --> 12:03.680
Heavenly Fang of Storms!

12:10.490 --> 12:11.500
What?

12:11.500 --> 12:13.120
What do you think of this?

12:15.020 --> 12:16.130
Hey!

12:16.130 --> 12:20.600
Whee! Spin faster! Spin, spin!

12:19.420 --> 12:22.130
This is no time for fun, Alas Ramus!

12:26.790 --> 12:31.520
Stand up, Emilia. I know you 
can't be defeated so easily.

12:31.520 --> 12:36.020
You know, I realize we have to 
fight all-out right now.

12:36.490 --> 12:38.340
I really do, but...

12:38.340 --> 12:41.280
that hurt! I hit the roof nose-first!

12:41.780 --> 12:43.530
Shockwave of Light!

12:49.580 --> 12:52.060
Don't damage the place too much.

12:52.490 --> 12:56.290
Nord Justina is being held 
in the Cloud Retreat.

12:57.790 --> 13:02.710
If we damage the castle keep greatly 
enough to affect the Cloud Retreat,

13:02.710 --> 13:04.550
the worst may happen.

13:04.550 --> 13:07.230
Your father survived this long.

13:07.230 --> 13:09.810
I'm sure you don't want to 
lose him in a farce like this.

13:10.830 --> 13:12.020
Really?

13:14.470 --> 13:19.310
Dad is really that close by?

13:19.740 --> 13:24.310
You won't get him back the way 
things stand now, of course.

13:24.850 --> 13:30.580
If you make any suspicious moves, 
he'll be beyond your reach in no time.

13:31.380 --> 13:32.510
I see...

13:34.010 --> 13:35.830
Have you lost your will to fight?

13:36.480 --> 13:40.210
Thank you. Now I'm prepared to keep dancing.

13:40.210 --> 13:44.970
And to rampage a little 
after we're done dancing, too.

13:44.970 --> 13:46.840
Excellent.

13:50.330 --> 13:54.850
They've been fighting for seven 
hours now. Talk about energy!

13:55.550 --> 13:58.600
I don't remember the guy 
being that strong, though.

13:58.600 --> 14:02.610
Didn't he get beaten up by you, Gab?

14:02.610 --> 14:06.310
Eh, maybe that was because we were in Japan.

14:06.310 --> 14:10.030
Emilia had better not be holding back.

14:10.030 --> 14:11.120
Hmm?

14:11.590 --> 14:14.090
She has Yesod's power.

14:14.090 --> 14:18.500
She should be more than a match 
for a demon like that. Why isn't she?!

14:18.940 --> 14:21.500
Chamuel, your tone is kinda scary.

14:21.880 --> 14:25.750
Imperfect or not, she's still 
the mistletoe of a sephirah.

14:26.160 --> 14:29.600
You know very well how 
formidable that power is.

14:29.980 --> 14:36.790
Yeah, good point—it did let Satan 
wipe the floor with you, after all.

14:36.790 --> 14:38.270
How dare you!

14:38.270 --> 14:42.070
Well, Emilia won't lose.

14:42.070 --> 14:44.350
And on the off chance she flags,

14:44.350 --> 14:47.800
it may be a little ahead of schedule, 
but we can step in and help!

14:47.800 --> 14:49.070
Right?

14:49.070 --> 14:51.520
Once she's nice and exhausted, of course.

14:53.880 --> 14:55.060
What're those?

14:56.580 --> 14:59.210
Weren't they called "scooters"?

15:00.030 --> 15:01.780
Finally.

15:06.730 --> 15:08.910
Maou! Big Sis is over there!

15:08.910 --> 15:10.180
I know, I know!

15:16.180 --> 15:21.550
Man, what the hell? This is like 
the worst possible scenario!

15:22.290 --> 15:23.810
What're those?

15:23.810 --> 15:25.180
A new kind of demon?

15:25.180 --> 15:25.890
Stop them!

15:25.890 --> 15:26.760
Just shoot!

15:26.760 --> 15:27.440
Fire!

15:30.570 --> 15:32.400
Uh-oh! What now?

15:32.400 --> 15:35.910
Full speed ahead! Believe in the 
power of Japanese automakers!

15:37.400 --> 15:38.730
Seriously?!

15:38.730 --> 15:41.140
Argh, I don't even care anymore!

15:41.140 --> 15:43.330
Move or we'll hit you!

15:43.330 --> 15:44.720
Out of the way!

15:44.720 --> 15:47.590
Insurance won't cover you 
if you get hit in Ente Isla!

15:47.590 --> 15:49.300
Move it!

15:50.730 --> 15:54.800
Alas Ramus, Ashiya, Emi—I'm here!

16:06.820 --> 16:08.570
Satan!

16:06.820 --> 16:08.570
King Satan!

16:08.890 --> 16:11.320
Why pizza delivery scooters?!

16:17.330 --> 16:19.080
They're catching up, Maou!

16:22.710 --> 16:25.080
All right, follow the plan!

16:25.080 --> 16:26.700
I'm on it!

16:43.810 --> 16:45.210
You okay, Acieth?

16:45.210 --> 16:46.430
Too smoky...

16:47.610 --> 16:49.100
Face forward!

16:55.070 --> 16:58.750
Those turned out pretty well for DIY bombs!

17:02.280 --> 17:05.470
Here, take a wooden sword 
to threaten people with.

17:05.470 --> 17:07.460
You're really enjoying this.

17:07.460 --> 17:09.130
Threatening only, though.

17:09.580 --> 17:11.970
If push comes to shove, 
throw it at the enemy.

17:11.970 --> 17:14.760
Just do your best to avoid hurting anyone.

17:14.760 --> 17:16.820
Don't forget that!

17:18.170 --> 17:22.020
Suzuno, please come back and stop Maou!

17:23.600 --> 17:28.770
Are you sure we shouldn't 
send an idea link to the Devil?

17:28.770 --> 17:33.780
An intercepted message could 
endanger him and Acieth Alla.

17:42.370 --> 17:44.040
Hey, look.

17:50.310 --> 17:52.640
That's the Cathedral of Oreus!

17:52.640 --> 17:56.170
We're right next to Saint Aire?

17:56.710 --> 17:59.190
We lost hope too soon.

17:59.690 --> 18:03.360
Know what's happening 
in that cathedral right now?

18:04.180 --> 18:05.570
Out of the way!

18:12.190 --> 18:14.820
Maou! Demons and a bald guy!

18:14.820 --> 18:16.520
D-Demon King Satan?!

18:16.520 --> 18:17.790
H-His Majesty!

18:17.790 --> 18:19.450
That's His Majesty?!

18:19.450 --> 18:21.450
I don't care about Baldy or the demons!

18:21.950 --> 18:23.930
We're goin' straight into the castle!

18:23.930 --> 18:25.200
Sound the horn!

18:36.120 --> 18:39.080
I so didn't want to see that...

18:39.080 --> 18:41.580
but whatever! Give it all you've got!

18:41.580 --> 18:45.470
Do what you want! I take no responsibility!

18:47.230 --> 18:47.940
Satan?!

18:47.940 --> 18:48.850
Sire!

18:55.360 --> 18:56.860
Dad!

18:56.860 --> 19:00.240
Oh, no! At this rate, the Cloud Retreat will—

19:22.960 --> 19:24.600
Sire.

19:24.600 --> 19:29.890
Sheesh! I didn't get my license, 
I owe Suzuno a fortune,

19:29.890 --> 19:32.670
and I skipped a week of shifts,

19:32.670 --> 19:36.530
so I'll have to make the rounds 
thanking everyone who covered for me.

19:36.530 --> 19:38.410
I can't catch a break.

19:39.070 --> 19:41.820
I'm giving you two 
an earful when we get home.

19:41.820 --> 19:43.160
Yes, Your Majesty.

19:45.120 --> 19:47.660
I'm sorry I caused you trouble.

19:48.450 --> 19:51.920
What's with you? Did you eat something weird?

19:52.610 --> 19:57.420
E-Everyone has moments like these. Even me.

19:57.420 --> 20:00.040
Is someone controlling you?

20:00.430 --> 20:02.380
I told you, it's just me.

20:03.110 --> 20:05.570
If I ever return to Japan,

20:05.570 --> 20:08.810
I'll make all those apologies I owe you.

20:08.810 --> 20:10.790
O-Okay...

20:11.500 --> 20:14.310
Ashiya, don't you think Emi's acting weird?

20:14.680 --> 20:16.720
Maou!

20:27.580 --> 20:29.670
D-Dad...

20:31.510 --> 20:36.330
Emi, I don't expect forgiveness 
for what I did back then, either.

20:37.160 --> 20:39.140
But I found a lost treasure of yours,

20:39.140 --> 20:42.650
so I'm giving it back to you 
as a token of my apology.

20:47.690 --> 20:50.920
Dad's really alive...

20:51.460 --> 20:53.390
This isn't a dream, right?

20:54.290 --> 20:56.280
Papa! Papa came!

20:56.280 --> 20:58.650
Mama, I'm going to Papa!

20:58.650 --> 21:01.100
Huh? O-Oh, okay.

21:02.170 --> 21:04.110
Papa!

21:04.110 --> 21:06.400
Hiya, Alas Ramus!

21:06.400 --> 21:09.240
There's someone I wanted you to see, 
so I brought her with me.

21:09.240 --> 21:10.260
Yeah!

21:11.260 --> 21:13.750
Acieth, long time no see!

21:15.750 --> 21:17.380
Is she...?

21:17.750 --> 21:20.660
Acieth, you grew up!

21:24.710 --> 21:30.500
Big Sis, you surprised me—
you're still a baby!

21:30.890 --> 21:33.520
Big Sis!

21:33.520 --> 21:36.460
I missed you so much!

21:37.210 --> 21:41.020
Don't cry, Acieth. Good girl!

21:44.030 --> 21:47.450
I was so lonely!

21:45.150 --> 21:47.450
U-Um, so...

21:47.450 --> 21:49.020
Listen, the way I figure it,

21:49.020 --> 21:52.600
we'll just have to hold a big family 
meeting when we get home.

21:54.000 --> 21:55.590
But first...

22:03.190 --> 22:04.920
Ga'riel.
